"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,17)\">Dan 6:17</ref> resuming the subject in predication (<highlight>ib.</highlight> <b>3 b</b>) <ref ref=\"Dan 2:20\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,20)\">Dan 2:20</ref> <bdbarc>חָכְמְתָא וּגְבוּרְתָּא דִּילֵֿהּ הִיא</bdbarc> <highlight>it</highlight> is his, v<ref ref=\"Dan 2:28\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,28)\">Dan 2:28</ref>. Anticipating the subject (<highlight>ib.</highlight> <b>4 a</b>) <ref ref=\"Dan 2:9\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,9)\">Dan 2:9</ref> <bdbarc>חֲדָא הִיא דָֽתְכוֺן</bdbarc>; with a pronoun (<highlight>ib.</highlight> <b>4 b</b>) <ref ref=\"Dan 2:38\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,38)\">Dan 2:38</ref> <bdbheb>אַנְתְּה הוּא ֗֗֗ </bdbheb> <highlight>thou art</highlight> the head of gold <ref ref=\"Dan 5:13\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(27,5,13)\">Dan 5:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 3:15\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,15)\">Dan 3:15</ref> <bdbheb>מָן הוּא אֱלָהּ ֗֗֗ </bdbheb> <highlight>who is</highlight> the god . . . ? (so plural <bdbarc>אִנּוּן</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Ezra 5:4\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,4)\">Ezra 5:4</ref>); <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Ezra 4:27\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,27)\">Ezra 4:27</ref> <bdbheb>הֲלָא דָא הִיא ֗֗֗ </bdbheb> (<highlight>ib.</highlight> <b>4 b</b> <grk>γ</grk>); <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Ezra 6:27\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(15,6,27)\">Ezra 6:27</ref> <bdbheb>דִּי הוּא ֗֗֗ </bdbheb> <highlight>who is</highlight> . . . (<highlight>ib.</highlight> <b>2 c</b>), <ref ref=\"Ezra 6:15\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegi